{'symbol': 'AFL', 'date': '2022-03-21 07:00:00', 'title': 'AFLAC INCORPORATED RELEASES 2021 BUSINESS AND SUSTAINABILITY REPORT', 'text': 'THE AFLAC WAY: MAKING A DIFFERENCE WHILE BALANCING PURPOSE AND PROFIT COLUMBUS, GA., MARCH 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AFLAC INCORPORATED ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY HAS RELEASED ITS 2021 BUSINESS AND SUSTAINABILITY REPORT, TITLED "THE AFLAC WAY: MAKING A DIFFERENCE WHILE BALANCING PURPOSE AND PROFIT.'}